{"id":"baa56d22ed548761","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md","title":"Riemann Zeta Function","display":"df-riemann-zeta — Riemann Zeta Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-riemann-zeta","aliases":["58-df-riemann-zeta","Riemann Zeta Function"],"display":"df-riemann-zeta — Riemann Zeta Function","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-riemann-zeta"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-riemann-zeta</span><span>Riemann Zeta Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-riemann-zeta — Riemann Zeta Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d60e86f21ed502a\" href=\"?note=5d60e86f21ed502a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md\">../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,z\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S\\)</span> (Dirichlet 级数和值域谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d60e86f21ed502a\" href=\"?note=5d60e86f21ed502a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md\">../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathbb C^2\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathbb C^2\\)</span> (graph on the half-plane of absolute convergence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta\">\\(\\zeta\\)</span> (compatible partial-function notation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S(s,z)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists a,D,f\\;\\Bigl(\na\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land a(0)=0\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(a(n)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D)\n\\land s\\in D\\land z=f(s)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S(s,z)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists a,D,f\\;\\Bigl(\na\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land a(0)=0\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(a(n)=1)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D)\n\\land s\\in D\\land z=f(s)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\zeta(s)=z\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S(s,z)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\zeta(s)=z\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S(s,z)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Zeta is the Dirichlet series with coefficients <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(n)=1\">\\(a(n)=1\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span> (the unused <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(0)\">\\(a(0)\\)</span> is fixed to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>); convergence and uniqueness of its sum are inherited from the exact Dirichlet-series predicate.</li>\n<li>Euler 乘积、亚纯延拓、唯一极点与函数方程都是由该定义继续得到的定理，不作为额外定义式。</li>\n<li>RH: all nontrivial zeros satisfy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Re}(s) = 1/2\">\\(\\mathrm{Re}(s) = 1/2\\)</span></li>\n<li>Functional equation: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta(1-s) = 2^s \\pi^{s-1} \\sin(\\pi s/2) \\Gamma(1-s)\\zeta(s)\">\\(\\zeta(1-s) = 2^s \\pi^{s-1} \\sin(\\pi s/2) \\Gamma(1-s)\\zeta(s)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Iwaniec, Quantum Modular Forms</li>\n<li>Titchmarsh, The Theory of the Riemann Zeta-Function</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d60e86f21ed502a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d60e86f21ed502a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S$ (Dirichlet 级数和值域谓词, see [[../batch19/58-df-dirichlet-series.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,z\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S\\subseteq\\mathbb C^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}zeta}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S(s,z)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&s,z\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists a,D,f\\;\\Bigl(\na\\in\\mathbb C^\\omega\\land a(0)=0\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(a(n)=1)\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land\\mathrm{DirichletSeries}_S(f,a,D)\n\\land s\\in D\\land z=f(s)\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}riemann\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\zeta(s)=z\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannZetaGraph}_S(s,z)","display":true},{"tex":"a(n)=1","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"a(0)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Re}(s) = 1/2","display":false},{"tex":"\\zeta(1-s) = 2^s \\pi^{s-1} \\sin(\\pi s/2) \\Gamma(1-s)\\zeta(s)","display":false}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"04c0cf141af8331a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\zeta:\\{s\\in\\mathbb C\\mid s\\neq1\\}\\to\\mathbb C$（Riemann zeta 函数，see [[../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md]]）"},{"id":"01a9b20b9e439456","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"01c0000762f5699a","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1096","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-riemann-zeta.md|58-df-riemann-zeta]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["5d60e86f21ed502a"]}